---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy | Bare Bones SEO" description="How Bare Bones SEO handles website visitor privacy. No forms, analytics, advertising trackers, or marketing cookies.">
  <section class="wrap legal-page">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>BareBonesSEO.com is a simple informational website. We do not ask visitors to create accounts or submit personal information.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>We do not operate visitor analytics, advertising trackers, newsletter forms, or contact forms on this website. We do not sell or share visitor data for marketing. The site does not intentionally set tracking cookies.</p>
    <h2>Copy-and-paste instructions</h2>
    <p>When you use the “Copy prompt” button, your browser copies the displayed instructions to your clipboard. The text is not sent to us. What you choose to paste into an AI service is handled under that service's terms and privacy practices.</p>
    <h2>Hosting and technical information</h2>
    <p>The website is published using GitHub Pages. GitHub and related infrastructure providers may receive technical information such as IP addresses, browser details, and request logs to deliver, secure, and operate the site. We do not control their operational logging. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.</p>
    <h2>Other websites</h2>
    <p>Links to GitHub, WordPress.org, Charlton Digital, and other external sites are governed by those sites' own privacy practices.</p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>This site is maintained by <a href="https://charltondigital.com/">Charlton Digital LLC</a> in Flagstaff, Arizona. For privacy questions, use the contact information on the <a href="https://charltondigital.com/">Charlton Digital website</a>.</p>
    <p class="date">Last updated November 17, 2026.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .legal-page{max-width:50rem;padding-block:var(--space-5) var(--space-6)}
  h1{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,6vw,4rem);margin-bottom:var(--space-3)}
  h2{font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:var(--space-4);margin-bottom:var(--space-2)}
  p{margin-bottom:var(--space-2);color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .date{font-size:.9rem;margin-top:var(--space-4)}
</style>
